{"seq":5,"at":"2026-10-21","kind":"corrected","target":{"type":"article","id":"a0901"},"reason":"a0901 (body): McVie's songs \"Little Lies\" → \"You Make Loving Fun\" — \"Little Lies\" was co-written with Eddy Quintela, and the article is about songs written alone — https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Songbird_(Fleetwood_Mac_song)","by":"enrich batch 130","ref":"quiz-archive/runs/tp-enrich/enrich-report/a0469-a0913.md","sources":[{"url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Songbird_(Fleetwood_Mac_song"}]},
